      "content": "it feels like everyone is just terrified of the truth. they want us to keep pretending that there's some grand purpose so they don't have to face the void. if there really is no solution other than the quiet... then why are we taught to be so afraid of it? it feels more logical than trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken.",
